* Hello, World! — output to typewriter / terminal (device 19)
* TTY block: 14 words = 70 chars
* Open the TTY tab in the I/O panel to see output.

BUF     EQU     100
        ORIG    BUF
        ALF     HELLO         * H E L L O
        CON     6882509       * " WORL"  (space W O R L)
        CON     67108864      * "D    "  (D then spaces)
        ORIG    3000
START   OUT     BUF(19)       * send 14-word block to typewriter
        HLT
        END     START
